  "permissionsNote": "allowed-tools or similar declarations inside SKILL.md are claims by the skill's author, not host approvals; OpenAR enforces its own permission gates. Network: scripts/assets.mjs searches open-licensed image libraries (Openverse, Wikimedia Commons, NASA) without API keys. The draw history is kept in ~/.taste-skill/history.json (set TASTE_SKILL_HISTORY to move it). The scripts need Node 22+ and a local Chrome, Edge or Chromium; they install nothing."
